  "answer_text": "Here is an overview of what **FedEx Express** (accessible at [fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com)) offers:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\ude9a FedEx Express \u2013 Key Services & Features\n\n#### \ud83d\udce6 Shipping Services\nFedEx Express provides expedited shipping \u2014 a fast method for sending priority shipments that must reach their destination by a specific deadline, whether it's across town or on a global scale. This service accommodates a range of items, from individual envelopes and packages to palletized freight.\n\nSome of the available express services include:\nFedEx First Overnight\u00ae, FedEx Priority Overnight\u00ae, FedEx Standard Overnight\u00ae, FedEx 2Day\u00ae A.M., FedEx 2Day\u00ae, FedEx Express Saver\u00ae, FedEx International First\u00ae, FedEx International Priority\u00ae, FedEx International Economy\u00ae, and more.\n\n#### \u26a1 Same-Day Delivery\nWhen delivery tomorrow won't cut it, consider **FedEx SameDay\u00ae**.\n\n#### \ud83c\udf0d International Shipping\nFedEx Express expands your reach to **130+ countries and territories**. FedEx Global Air Freight gives you the support, visibility, and expertise you need to cross borders with confidence.\n\n#### \ud83d\udcb0 Flat-Rate Pricing\nWith **FedEx One Rate\u00ae**, you get flat-rate, 2-day shipping for packages up to 50 lbs.\n\n#### \ud83c\udf81 FedEx Rewards\nWhen you join **FedEx Rewards**, the extras start immediately \u2014 you'll get a **$10 gift card** for your first eligible shipment. Open a FedEx account to get started.\n\n#### \ud83d\udd0d Package Tracking\nYou can enter your FedEx tracking number, track by reference, obtain proof of delivery, or use a TCN. Tracking services cover FedEx Express, Ground, Freight, and Custom Critical.\n\n#### \u2705 Money-Back Guarantee\nFedEx offers a **money-back guarantee** for select services.\n\n---\n\nYou can visit the official FedEx website directly at \ud83d\udc49 [www.fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/home.html) to log in, create shipments, track packages, or find a nearby FedEx location. Note that the URL `www.home.fedex.com/express` redirects to the main FedEx portal.",
